<template><view :data-skin="scenicSkin" class="visual-page safe"><SceneBackdrop :src="backgrounds.engagement" :shade=".75"/><TopBar title="设置" eyebrow="VIEWING PREFERENCES" @back="back" @settings="back"/><AssetPanel class="settings-panel"><view class="settings-tabs"><button role="button" tabindex="0" @keydown.enter.prevent="activateFocused" @keydown.space.prevent="activateFocused" v-for="t in tabs" :key="t" :class="{active:tab===t}" @click="tab=t">{{t}}</button></view><view v-if="tab==='画面'"><view class="setting-row"><text>界面皮肤</text><SkinSwitch/></view><text class="visual-copy">山河新生默认开启；完成序章关键抉择后，自动解锁余烬鎏金。皮肤选择永久保存。</text><view class="setting-row"><text>字幕</text><switch :checked="settingsStore.subtitles" color="#7fa9a3" @change="toggleSubtitles"/></view><text class="visual-copy">暖象牙字幕，保持画面清晰。</text></view><view v-else-if="tab==='声音'"><view class="setting-row"><text>静音</text><switch :checked="settingsStore.muted" color="#7fa9a3" @change="toggleMuted"/></view><text class="visual-copy">应用于剧情播放器。</text></view><view v-else-if="tab==='游戏'" class="settings-copy"><text>每一次选择都会自动记录。</text><text>回到首页可继续当前人生；开始新人生会保留此前周目的记录。</text><text>键盘：↑ ↓ 移动选择，Enter 确认，Esc 暂停。</text></view><view v-else-if="tab==='语言'" class="setting-row"><text>界面语言</text><text>简体中文</text></view><view v-else class="settings-copy"><text class="about-title">万界开了，<br/>我在末日景区搞基建</text><text>一个关于选择、记忆与自我的互动故事。</text><text>版本 0.1.0</text></view><AssetImage class="visual-divider" :src="uiAssets.decorations.line" fit="fill"/><text class="session-note">皮肤跨周目保存；影音偏好在本次打开期间生效</text><AssetButton class="settings-back" @click="back">返回</AssetButton></AssetPanel></view></template><script setup lang="ts">
import SkinSwitch from '../../components/common/SkinSwitch.vue';
import {activateFocused} from '../../utils/keyboard';
import {ref} from 'vue';import {goBack} from '../../utils/navigation';import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.vue';import AssetImage from '../../components/common/AssetImage.vue';import AssetPanel from '../../components/common/AssetPanel.vue';import AssetButton from '../../components/common/AssetButton.vue';import SceneBackdrop from '../../components/common/SceneBackdrop.vue';import {uiAssets} from '../../config/ui-assets';import {backgrounds} from '../../data/backgrounds';import {settingsStore} from '../../store/settings';const tabs=['画面','声音','游戏','语言','关于'],tab=ref('画面');function back(){goBack()}function toggleSubtitles(e:Event|{detail:{value:boolean}}){if('detail' in e)settingsStore.subtitles=e.detail.value}function toggleMuted(e:Event|{detail:{value:boolean}}){if('detail' in e)settingsStore.muted=e.detail.value}</script><style scoped>.settings-panel{position:relative;width:min(740px,90vw);margin:8vh auto;min-height:380px;--panel-opacity:.17;background:#08090b80}.settings-tabs{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid #b6915540;gap:18px;margin-bottom:20px}.settings-tabs button{color:#bbb;background:none;padding:12px 8px;font-size:14px;border-radius:0;min-height:44px}.settings-tabs button.active{color:#e5c982;border-bottom:1px solid #b69155}.setting-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:30px 0;font-size:14px}.settings-panel .visual-divider{height:3px;width:100%;opacity:.3;margin-top:35px}.settings-copy{min-height:130px;padding-top:20px}.settings-copy text{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;margin:10px 0;color:#cfc8ba}.settings-copy .about-title{font:26px/1.5 'Songti SC',serif}.session-note{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8b8980;margin:15px 0 25px}.settings-back{width:140px}@media(orientation:portrait){.settings-panel{margin:25px auto;width:90vw}.settings-tabs{gap:3px;justify-content:space-between}.settings-tabs button{font-size:13px;padding:10px 5px}}</style>